<title>USA: HA-LO votes 25 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>HA-LO votes 25 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc said on Thursday that it voted a 25 percent stock dividend on its common stock, payable December 11, record November 21.</p>
<p>There currently are about 13.1 million shares outstanding. Following the dividend, the distributor of specialty premium advertising products will have about 16.4 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
